  "bodyHash": "ejtZ8hq/jR4=",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">想要搶先體驗新更新、幕後花絮或額外好康，同時支持我和《Reimagined》的開發嗎？</span> 考慮贊助我的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/Reijvi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon！</a> &lt;3</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/b1a381494dca16aaaab3e5a8ae288edd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>《Reimagined》，一封致《Minecraft》的情書</h2><p>《Reimagined》是一個持續進行中的作品，是一場全面的革新，以大大小小、或顯著或細微的方式改變盡可能多的內容。從數百種新的方塊變體、完全重新製作的介面、新的音效、動畫、生態域色彩、生物、粒子效果等等！《Reimagined》希望能包含一點每個人都能享受的內容。</p><p>最終，《Reimagined》希望能讓你的像素世界感覺更像一個真實、充滿生機、你可以沉浸其中的世界，同時仍忠於《Minecraft》那熟悉而溫馨的魅力。</p><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/9cef9a67335ae61963102acebc66a831.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/14e4ffe26741511cf22d3b7558a49749.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">要獲得所有《Reimagined》功能，請使用這些模組！</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> </span> 自訂生物模型所需</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">POLYTONE</a> </span> 用於更好的色彩映射、更好的 Sodium 相容性等（適用於 1.21.6 之前版本的村民介面）</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CONTINUITY</a></span> 用於連接紋理，例如木板邊框、地毯 CTM、草地覆蓋層等</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RESPACKOPTS 1.21+</a></span> 用於透過遊戲內設定進一步自訂《Reimagined》。目前需要此模組來啟用改進的草地或茂密樹葉等功能，因為這些功能是透過設定啟用的。\n如果你想在沒有 Respackopts 的情況下使用草叢草地，請務必使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgrassy-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grassy Grass 附加元件</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodefite-item-definition-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MODEFITE 1.21.4 之前版本</a></span>\n用於將新版本的功能移植到舊版本，這包括像是 3D 水桶或手持物品時的 3D 效果等內容。如果你使用的是 1.21.4 或更高版本，則不需要此模組。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069297933293473852/features.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1>一些值得注意的功能：</h1><h2>全新的《Reimagined》介面</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6c24a86651c1fd2bdb63efe61a1c0b6c908ff3c.gif\" alt=\"Villager\"> <img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/03429a864bce71ba4e9d39227015e585.png\" alt=\"Furnace\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/dc295d3091dc4082bf2eb5123e9fc46d.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/7af08c39ca84dcc08a7e2e141621649a.gif\" alt=\"Crafting_Table\"></p><h2>動畫功能</h2><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/858b33a23b1e0aefdafc7288ac550f39.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/4e06e8b3a30899317d62a3a80591fe93.gif\" alt=\"Furnaces\"></p><h1>沉浸式的世界</h1><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/50705d325739837448b00922638d581a.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d49d870458a3b3a532958d17a790eac9.gif\" alt=\"Jungle\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/edf3610d77713118dcfa387fd4b40f87.gif\" alt=\"ArmorLantern\"></p><h1>新的植被</h1><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/407695f8d0fcf777e820fa97adf82e06.gif\" alt=\"Foliage\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/8ab4ac943dab9bab4db4ff8c3dd1b11a.gif\" alt=\"Foliage\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/a5551d9520105d6354a3bbd74451b1da.gif\" alt=\"Savanna\"></p><h1>生物多樣性</h1><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d65f998f901d85251282224ec6b886c9.png\" alt=\"Skellies\"></p><h1>還有更多，更多！</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252freijvi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/aa729799ffa7b99f1cf7b14c3e8cf79e.png\" alt=\"Donate\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069296962010091630/addons.png\" width=\"1338\" height=\"91\"></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>附加元件：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-fresh-animations-patch\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations 相容性修補檔</a><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dark-gui-reimagined/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2b3e50\">深色介面</span></a></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252freimagined-colormap-fix%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong><br>白色色彩映射修復</strong></span></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-night-panaroma\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#339\"><strong>夜晚全景圖</strong></span></a></span><br><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#396\"><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimagined 3D+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-bushy-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">茂密樹葉啟用器</span></strong></a></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>非官方附加元件：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spryzeens-health-bars/files/4072909\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0cf\">生命值條（Spryzeen 的生命值條相容性附加元件）</span></a><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252femissive-ores-fore-mc-reimagined-by-reijvi%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#f1c40f\">發光礦石</span></a></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fminecraft-reimagined-dark-mode-gui%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#2b3e50\">深色模式介面</span></a></span></strong></span></span></p></div><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">建議使用美式英語語言進行遊戲，</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;因為我重新命名並修改了一些文字顏色和名稱，其中一些會影響介面！</span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>特別感謝：</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><strong>致謝名單：</strong></p><p>- un_roman，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fun_roman%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 非常友善並創作了《Reimagined》的文字標誌！</p><p>- RickyMemester，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252f1-17-style-variated-ores%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允許我借用他的一些原始礦石紋理變體，這些變體我之前用在我較舊的「Randomize It」中並進行了相當大的修改。</p><p>- DartCat25，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fdartcat25%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允許我借用他的「Menus - Enchanted」以及他的「Rotating Items」著色器，使《Reimagined》的一些功能得以實現。</p><p>- Godlander，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fgodlander%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允許我借用他的「Animated Skin」著色器，使《Reimagined》的一些功能得以實現。</p><p>- Cosmoman，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fcosmoman_476%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 幫助並貢獻了大量紋理、移植深板岩礦石、一致性修改等等。</p><p>- ShrimpSnail，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fshrimpsnail%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 允許我借用並改編他們在 The Great Shrimpsby 資源包中的附魔書 CEM 動畫。</p><p>- EwanHowell，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fewanhowell5195%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 幫助了我太多，多到我數不清，他是我學會製作資源包的最大原因。</p><p>- Barebones，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>(資源包)</strong></a> 用於全景圖。</p><p>- Complementary Reimagined 作為首選的截圖著色器（我知道這很諷刺）</p></div><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rstmkrGeFJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069439024659447868/discord_big_big.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5a2618c30403aaceb78a5bceb2b8efd2.png\" width=\"1148\" height=\"191\"></span></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;undefined</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">undefined</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#036\">想要支持《Reimagined》嗎？在<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">無需額外費用</span>的情況下，我可以透過 undefined此連結undefined 進",
